    "服务器返回了无法识别的响应，请确认这是 OpenCloudreve 站点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server returned an unrecognized response. Make sure this is an OpenCloudreve site."
